{"title":"SSS-Class Suicide Hunter","synopsis":"Di Menara misterius yang mirip dengan dungeon RPG Kim Gongja menjalani kehidupan duniawi yang membuat iri semua star hunter\n\nSuatu hari ketamakannya dikabulkan dengan legendary skill untuk menyalin kemampuan orang lain  dengan mengorbankan nyawanya sendiri\n\nSebelum dia sadar  dia dibunuh oleh hunter 1 Flame Emperor Tapi hal itu mengaktifkan Skill nya dan kemampuan untuk melakukan perjalanan kembali ke masa lalu setelah kematian\n\nBagaimana Gongja menggunakan keterampilan ini untuk mengalahkan kompetisi dan naik ke puncak","alternative_title":"SSS급 죽어야 사는 헌터, SSS-Class Hunter that has to Die to Live, SSS-Class Revival Hunter","author":"Shin Noah and Naida","artist":"Bill K","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Isekai","Psychological"],"chapters":[{"id":"91322444-d7b4-493f-96aa-654e95511ac1","number":"151","title":"Chapter 151","date":"2025-09-04","images":[]},{"id":"1092972d-7c37-4fb5-a660-6da555038c69","number":"150","title":"Chapter 150","date":"2025-08-28","images":[]},{"id":"4fee2b27-2682-48bb-b310-f79b832824a0","number":"149","title":"Chapter 149","date":"2025-08-21","images":[]},{"id":"58a3f358-03d6-4740-8e77-979bdae8d7f1","number":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2025-08-14","images":[]},{"id":"76ec1356-2c79-41dd-ba37-1eef654fa612","number":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2025-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"262d39d1-3390-48ff-8faa-51c5501b596f","number":"146","title":"Chapter 146","date":"2025-07-24","images":[]},{"id":"3bee1f38-e6ed-4121-8a56-63b9be1b9112","number":"145","title":"Chapter 145","date":"2025-07-17","images":[]},{"id":"5e086193-6637-4aad-a856-641b3e09e78e","number":"144","title":"Chapter 144","date":"2025-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"523eea3a-c338-4573-880d-881085bfc0b5","number":"143","title":"Chapter 143","date":"2025-07-03","images":[]},{"id":"03b9903f-5667-4837-b308-f3e10883d878","number":"142","title":"Chapter 142","date":"2025-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"2122f9f1-72b